{
  "presses": [
    "R-index-bottom-in",
    "L-index-bottom",
    "R-middle-top",
    "L-ring-home"
  ],
  "note": "T3: {L-index-bottom,L-pinky-bottom,R-index-top-in,R-index-bottom-in}->{F,K,P,S}; rot after {L-index-home-in,L-ring-bottom,L-ring-top}. T4: {R-index-bottom-in,L-index-bottom,L-pinky-bottom,R-middle-home}->{D,K,S,T}; rot after {L-index-home,L-index-home-in,L-middle-bottom}. Earlier claim R-index-bottom-in=F seems inconsistent with T4; don’t reuse. Plan T5 chord: R-index-bottom-in+L-index-bottom+R-middle-top+L-ring-home."
}

{
  "presses": [
    "R-index-bottom-in",
    "R-index-top-in",
    "R-index-bottom",
    "L-ring-home"
  ],
  "note": "Known from T5/T6: {R-index-bottom-in,L-index-bottom}={D,K}; {R-index-bottom,L-ring-home}={F,J}. Also {R-index-top-in,R-middle-home}={P,T} (since D/K already on the first pair). T7 chord = {R-index-bottom-in,R-index-top-in,R-index-bottom,L-ring-home} => list should be {D or K, P or T, F, J}, letting T8 pinpoint which of D/K is on R-index-bottom-in. Track: after T6 rotated keys {L-index-top-in,R-ring-home} (swap)."
}

{
  "presses": ["L-ring-home", "R-index-top-in", "R-middle-home", "L-pinky-top"],
  "note": "Upd Known: L-ring-home=F; L-middle-home=X; L-index-home=K; L-index-bottom=R; R-index-top-in=P; R-index-bottom-in=D; R-index-bottom=J; R-middle-home=T. Plan T14 press {L-ring-home,R-index-top-in,R-middle-home,L-pinky-top} => L-pinky-top is leftover symbol after removing {F,P,T} from the 4-symbol set, if none of these keys rotated (if rotation includes any of them, re-evaluate)."
}

{
  "presses": ["L-ring-home", "L-middle-home", "R-middle-home", "R-index-home"],
  "locks": {
    "L-pinky-top": "Q"
  },
  "note": "Known: L-ring-home=F; L-middle-home=X; L-index-home=K; L-index-bottom=R; R-index-top-in=P; R-index-bottom-in=D; R-index-bottom=J; R-middle-home=T; L-pinky-top=Q. Plan T15 chord {L-ring-home,L-middle-home,R-middle-home,R-index-home} => if no rotation touches any of these 4, then R-index-home is the 4th symbol in set after removing {F,X,T}."
}

{
  "presses": ["L-ring-home", "L-middle-home", "R-middle-home", "L-index-top"],
  "locks": {"R-index-home": "E"},
  "note": "Now known: L-pinky-top=Q, L-ring-home=F, L-middle-home=X, L-index-home=K, L-index-bottom=R, L-middle-home=X, R-index-top-in=P, R-index-bottom-in=D, R-index-bottom=J, R-middle-home=T, R-index-home=E. Plan T16 press {L-ring-home,L-middle-home,R-middle-home,L-index-top}; if no rotation among these 4 then L-index-top = 4th symbol after removing {F,X,T} from sorted set."
}
